cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "To cite a specific result, use its problem-specific citation and exact source or declaration. The collection defaults to Apache-2.0, subject to package-specific exceptions. The combined #643 design proof package is GPL-3.0-only; individual Apache-origin source notices remain intact. See NOTICE, problems/643/coefficient-one-design/COPYING and problems/643/coefficient-one-design/NOTICE-DESIGN.md."
title: "Erdős: AI-assisted research in combinatorics and graph theory"
authors:
